  "limits_and_caveats": [
    "Four synthetic cases; one repetition; provisional legal gold.",
    "TypeDB context alone has identical model-visible case facts to the retrieval arm, so it is a backend parity control.",
    "TypeDB functions versus equivalent SQL tests external decision support; it cannot establish that such logic is unique to TypeDB.",
    "The first batch was cancelled after18 attempts because the prompt did not define relief_route as the canonical assessed code. Free-text but semantically correct descriptions could fail exact matching. The revised common prompt copies the public requested_route code. All32 cells are rerun; no favourable trials are selectively retained. These cases have now participated in harness validation, so this is an exploratory pilot, not an untouched holdout estimate.",
    "Provider-default reasoning;2048 output tokens and six model calls per trial. Lexical BM25 baseline. OpenRouter may vary upstream provider; small single-repetition dataset and provisional legal gold."
  ],
